{"score":4,"issues":["Core fee facts are correct and in Arabic: 3% of the chosen supplier's final quoted price after discount and excluding VAT, no cap, a correct example (3% of AED 1,700 = AED 51), and no card fee or VAT added on top.","Minor unsupported claims not in the platform facts: 'posting a request and comparing quotes are free' (نشر الطلب ومقارنة العروض مجانيان) and 'the full amount is shown before payment' (يظهر المبلغ كاملًا قبل الدفع). These are plausible but unverified, so they risk inventing facts.","'You only pay when revealing one supplier' (لا تدفع إلا عند كشف مورد واحد) is slightly ambiguous. It could imply only one supplier can ever be revealed."]}
